Z||000008||qwikgta||06-06-2001||08:19 PM||||I have an open element air cleaner on my 2.5  Check it out at my site below.<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe, 65K, Header, 16" GTZ rims, short shifter, swaybar. <A HREF="http://robsfieroproject.homestead.com/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://robsfieroproject.homestead.com/index.html</A>  <A HREF="http://vafiero.com" TARGET=_blank>http://vafiero.com</A> <P>[This message has been edited by qwikgta (edited 06-06-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by qwikgta (edited 06-06-2001).]||||reg||1
